WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.907 --> 00:00:19.727
Everything an instructor does starts from the kiosk.

2
00:00:19.727 --> 00:00:27.147
Tap Management, in the row under the two big buttons.

3
00:00:27.147 --> 00:00:30.332
The panel is behind your instructor PIN.

4
00:00:30.332 --> 00:00:34.554
Face ID is the shortcut — the PIN is what actually opens it.

5
00:00:34.554 --> 00:00:40.209
Type your PIN.

6
00:00:40.209 --> 00:00:45.678
Then tap Unlock.

7
00:00:45.678 --> 00:00:51.408
This is the Instructor Panel: Records, Add New and Export.

8
00:00:51.408 --> 00:00:57.838
Clara’s time is red: she went home without checking out.

9
00:00:57.838 --> 00:01:03.350
Every row of today has Check In and Check Out.

10
00:01:03.350 --> 00:01:09.924
Tap Check Out on her row.

11
00:01:09.924 --> 00:01:15.670
She moves to Already Done, checked out now.

12
00:01:15.670 --> 00:01:23.488
Need the time she really left? Edit Time sets it, and the change is logged.

13
00:01:23.488 --> 00:01:31.890
Check In works the same for someone you sign in at the door.

14
00:01:31.890 --> 00:01:39.567
Each button only lights up when it applies to that row.
